  "caption": "Extent and exposure from one post-event pass. The two exposure layers disagree: WorldPop puts about 17,600 people in the flood, while only 424 Microsoft footprints fall inside it. Rural houses under tree cover are often missing from footprint layers, so report both numbers and say why they differ. Google Open Buildings v3 barely covers this district (last column). A first estimate for response planning, not a damage assessment.",
